					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1158" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO DC 30762 Retro Video Game Batman GWP Mini Set Minifigure November 2026 Promo" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo.png 1158w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo-290x300.png 290w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo-988x1024.png 988w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo-768x796.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo-1024x1061.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1158px) 100vw, 1158px" /></p>
<p>All-new LEGO November 2026 Promotions &#38; GWP Gift with Purchases are now live at LEGO (USA &#124; Canada</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-penguins-in-love-gwp-retro-video-game-batman-gwp-double-points-on-spongebob-squarepants-bikini-bottom-more-promos-now-live-november-9-15-2026/">LEGO Penguins in Love GWP, Retro Video Game Batman GWP, Double Points on Spongebob Squarepants Bikini Bottom &#038; More Promos Now Live: November 9-15, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>All-new LEGO November 2026 Promotions &amp; GWP Gift with Purchases are now live at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>).</p>
<h3>US &amp; Canada Only &#8211; LEGO Penguins in Love 40886 GWP</h3>
<p>You can now get LEGO Penguins in Love 40886 GWP with orders over $100 USD / $130 CAD in LEGO purchases. Offer runs from November 9-15, 2026 or while supplies last. Valid in US &amp; Canada only.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-104309 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-40886-Penguins-in-Love-GWP-2026-Valentines-Day-Promo-February-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="651" height="879" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-40886-Penguins-in-Love-GWP-2026-Valentines-Day-Promo-February-Front-Box.jpg 651w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-40886-Penguins-in-Love-GWP-2026-Valentines-Day-Promo-February-Front-Box-222x300.jpg 222w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 651px) 100vw, 651px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-104310 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-40886-Penguins-in-Love-GWP-2026-Valentines-Day-Promo-February-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="644" height="870" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-40886-Penguins-in-Love-GWP-2026-Valentines-Day-Promo-February-Back-Box.jpg 644w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-40886-Penguins-in-Love-GWP-2026-Valentines-Day-Promo-February-Back-Box-222x300.jpg 222w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 644px) 100vw, 644px" /></p>
<h3>US, Canada &amp; UK Only &#8211; LEGO DC 30762 Retro Video Game Batman GWP</h3>
<p>From November 9-15, 2026 (or while supplies last), you can get the LEGO DC 30762 Retro Video Game Batman GWP. All you have to do is spend $40 USD / $50 CAD / £35 GBP  in LEGO DC or LEGO Batman items.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114497 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo.png" alt="" width="829" height="859" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo.png 1158w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo-290x300.png 290w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo-988x1024.png 988w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo-768x796.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-DC-30762-Retro-Video-Game-Batman-GWP-Mini-Set-Minifigure-November-2026-Promo-1024x1061.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 829px) 100vw, 829px" /></p>
<h3>United Kingdom Only &#8211; LEGO Restaurants of the World Japan 40906 GWP</h3>
<p>You can now get LEGO Restaurants of the World Japan 40906 GWP with orders over £160 GBP in LEGO purchases. Offer runs from November 9-15, 2026 or while supplies last. Valid in United Kingdom UK only. Must be LEGO Insiders (free to join).</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-104622 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-40906-Restaurants-of-the-World-Japan-GWP-2026-Front-Box-Upcoming-Gift-with-Purchase-Promo.jpg" alt="" width="854" height="867" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-40906-Restaurants-of-the-World-Japan-GWP-2026-Front-Box-Upcoming-Gift-with-Purchase-Promo.jpg 854w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-40906-Restaurants-of-the-World-Japan-GWP-2026-Front-Box-Upcoming-Gift-with-Purchase-Promo-296x300.jpg 296w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-40906-Restaurants-of-the-World-Japan-GWP-2026-Front-Box-Upcoming-Gift-with-Purchase-Promo-768x780.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 854px) 100vw, 854px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-104623 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-40906-Restaurants-of-the-World-Japan-GWP-2026-Back-Box-Upcoming-Gift-with-Purchase-Promo.jpg" alt="" width="851" height="861" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-40906-Restaurants-of-the-World-Japan-GWP-2026-Back-Box-Upcoming-Gift-with-Purchase-Promo.jpg 851w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-40906-Restaurants-of-the-World-Japan-GWP-2026-Back-Box-Upcoming-Gift-with-Purchase-Promo-297x300.jpg 297w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-40906-Restaurants-of-the-World-Japan-GWP-2026-Back-Box-Upcoming-Gift-with-Purchase-Promo-768x777.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 851px) 100vw, 851px" /></p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Worldwide GWP Gift with Purchase &amp; Promotions</span></h3>
<h3>LEGO Disney 30720 Ariel &amp; Flounder&#8217;s Birthday Music Fun GWP</h3>
<p>Spend $40 USD / $50 CAD / £35 GBP / $65 AUD or more on Disney LEGO items and you can get a free LEGO Disney 30720 Ariel &amp; Flounder&#8217;s Birthday Music Fun GWP gift set. Promotion runs from November 9-15, 2026 or while supplies last.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114496 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Disney-30720-Ariel-Flounders-Birthday-Music-Fun-GWP-November-2026-Mini-Set-Polybag.png" alt="" width="727" height="942" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Disney-30720-Ariel-Flounders-Birthday-Music-Fun-GWP-November-2026-Mini-Set-Polybag.png 926w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Disney-30720-Ariel-Flounders-Birthday-Music-Fun-GWP-November-2026-Mini-Set-Polybag-232x300.png 232w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Disney-30720-Ariel-Flounders-Birthday-Music-Fun-GWP-November-2026-Mini-Set-Polybag-790x1024.png 790w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-Disney-30720-Ariel-Flounders-Birthday-Music-Fun-GWP-November-2026-Mini-Set-Polybag-768x995.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 727px) 100vw, 727px" /></p>
<h3>Double Insider Points on 18+ LEGO Icons 11386 Spongebob Squarepants: Bikini Bottom</h3>
<p>From November 9-15, 2026, you can score double Insider reward points on the 18+ LEGO Icons 11386 Spongebob Squarepants: Bikini Bottom set. That&#8217;s basically 10% back in LEGO reward dollars!</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now &amp; See All Offers at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US United States</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
