<p>The LEGO Icons 40898 Venetian Water Taxi GWP gift promo has been extended. It now runs from November 1-20, 2026 or while supplies last. This gift set is free when you purchase the 18+ LEGO Icons 11388 Venetian Neighborhood set.</p>
