										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Evening LEGO Fans! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for tonight. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-97346 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Netflix-LEGO-One-Piece-75639-The-Going-Merry-Pirate-Ship-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="861" height="845" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Netflix-LEGO-One-Piece-75639-The-Going-Merry-Pirate-Ship-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 861w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Netflix-LEGO-One-Piece-75639-The-Going-Merry-Pirate-Ship-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x294.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Netflix-LEGO-One-Piece-75639-The-Going-Merry-Pirate-Ship-Summer-August-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x754.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 861px) 100vw, 861px" /></p>
<p>My top picks include <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-A-2026-72152/dp/B0FMYVG58P?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=976eea044daa65dda7c7f5c1597551a0&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Pokémon Pikachu and Poké Ball 72152</a> at 20% off for <strong>$159.95</strong> (reg.$199.99). This set was previously on sale but has been further reduced now. <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Piece-Pirate-Building-Blocks/dp/B0DRW5PCC3?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=8132d807e80f60400bb071ebbed85c1e&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO ONE PIECE The Going Merry Pirate Ship 75639</a> is also on sale for <strong>$115.99</strong> (reg.$139.99) which works out to be 17% off. It is one of the more popular One Piece sets from the initial release wave.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-103947 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72152-Pikachu-and-Poke-Ball-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="857" height="841" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72152-Pikachu-and-Poke-Ball-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 857w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72152-Pikachu-and-Poke-Ball-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x294.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/18-LEGO-Pokemon-72152-Pikachu-and-Poke-Ball-February-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x754.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 857px) 100vw, 857px" /></p>
<p>Lastly, I recommend the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Potter-Diagon-Wizarding-Building/dp/B0DHLHLX1B?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=d7fd336e008dde7d49bedac18b534eb0&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Harry Potter Diagon Alley Wizarding Shops 76444</a> which has been further reduced to <strong>$159.99</strong> (reg.$199.99). Savings now work out to be 20% off.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-92969 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="970" height="855" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 970w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x264.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/18-LEGO-Harry-Potter-76444-Diagon-Alley-Wizarding-Shops-January-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x677.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 970px) 100vw, 970px" /></p>
<p>Below are 14 of our Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, November 8, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
