					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="691" height="921" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-with-Instructions-Box.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Review LEGO IDEAS 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP November 2026 Promotion Gift with Purchase Toysnbricks Complete Set with Instructions &amp; Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-with-Instructions-Box.jpg 691w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-with-Instructions-Box-225x300.jpg 225w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 691px) 100vw, 691px" /></p>
<p>LEGO 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP is the current gift with purchase promotional item at LEGO (USA</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/review-lego-ideas-40889-build-paint-and-play-gwp-november-2026-promo-gift-set/">[Review] LEGO IDEAS 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP (November 2026 Promo Gift Set)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114476 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-with-Instructions-Box.jpg" alt="" width="691" height="921" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-with-Instructions-Box.jpg 691w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Review-LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-November-2026-Promotion-Gift-with-Purchase-Toysnbricks-Complete-Set-with-Instructions-Box-225x300.jpg 225w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 691px) 100vw, 691px" /></p>
<p>LEGO 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP is the current gift with purchase promotional item at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). It is free when you purchase over $130 USD / $170 CAD / £115 GBP / $210 AUD at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>). The promotion runs from October 28 to November 8, 2026 (or while supplies last). There&#8217;s only one more day left for this promotion. As of this review writing, LEGO 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP is still available at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>).</p>
<p>Alternatively, you can also buy LEGO 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP by itself on secondary marketplaces like at <a href="https://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=711-53200-19255-0&amp;siteid=0&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay USA</a> and <a href="https://www.ebay.ca/sch/i.html?_nkw=lego&amp;_sacat=0&amp;_from=R40&amp;_sop=1&amp;mkcid=1&amp;mkrid=706-53473-19255-0&amp;siteid=2&amp;campid=5339120024&amp;customid=&amp;toolid=10001&amp;mkevt=1">eBay Canada</a>.</p>
<p><em>Thank you to LEGO for providing Toys N Bricks a media copy sample of the LEGO IDEAS 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP for us to review. </em></p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll update you whenever there are any new LEGO promotions, GWP Gift with Purchases and Sales &amp; Deals.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-113743 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Lifestyle-4.jpg" alt="" width="1200" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Lifestyle-4.jpg 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Lifestyle-4-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Lifestyle-4-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Lifestyle-4-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<h3>LEGO 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP Review</h3>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Product Pricing &amp; Specifications &#8211; 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>Set Number: 40889</li>
<li>Recommended Age: 18+</li>
<li>Number of Pieces: 158</li>
<li>Release Date: October 28, 2026 (Not available for direct purchase but is a gift with purchase promo item)</li>
<li>Promo Period: October 28 to November 8 or while supplies last (November 2026 Promo Gift)</li>
<li>Promo Offer: Free with $130 USD / $170 CAD / £115 GBP / $210 AUD purchase at LEGO</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113737 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="683" height="795" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box.png 1031w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-258x300.png 258w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-880x1024.png 880w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-768x894.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Front-Box-1024x1192.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 683px) 100vw, 683px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113742 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="676" height="787" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box.png 1031w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box-258x300.png 258w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box-880x1024.png 880w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box-768x894.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/LEGO-IDEAS-40889-Build-Paint-and-Play-GWP-2026-Gift-with-Purchase-Promotion-Back-Box-1024x1192.png 1024w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 676px) 100vw, 676px" /></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h3><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Official Product Description &#8211; 40889 Build, Paint and Play! GWP</span></h3>
<p>Celebrate your love for arts and crafts with this Build, Paint and Play! (40889) set for adults, the winning entry from the LEGO Ideas Build Your Hobby competition. Discover model-building details like a cutting tool, sprue, glue, paint and a brush. The paint is labeled with the actual LEGO paint color, and an astronaut minifigure serves as the final product of this build-within-a-build. Display the model as a fun piece of decor for an office desk, bookshelf or coffee table centerpiece. Set contains 149 pieces.</p>
<p>-BUILD YOUR HOBBY – Celebrate your love for model building with LEGO® Build, Paint and Play! (40889), a kit-within-a-kit for adults that makes a creative display piece when complete</p>
<p>-MESS-FREE DETAILS – Don’t worry about spills or stains as you create your own brick-built versions of a cutting tool, sprue, glue, paint and brush</p>
<p>-STICKERS AND MINIFIGURE – Label the paint and glue tubes, craft a sticker transfer sheet and “paint” an astronaut minifigure with actual LEGO® colors</p>
<p>-OFFICE DESK DECOR – This eye-catching piece makes a great conversation starter for any office, living room or bedroom shelf</p>
<p>-GIFT IDEA – This set is an inspired gift for adults who love model building hobbies and is a fun idea for birthdays and special occasions</p>
<p>-DIMENSIONS &#8211; This 149-piece set measures over 2 in. (6 cm) high, 5.5 in. (15 cm) wide and 5.5 in. (14 cm) deep</p>
<p><strong>Shop Now at LEGO:</strong> <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a></p>
