		<item>
		<title>LEGOLAND UK Windsor Hotels Comparison (Britain, United Kingdom)</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/legoland-uk-windsor-hotels-comparison-britain-united-kingdom/</link>
					<comments>https://www.toysnbricks.com/legoland-uk-windsor-hotels-comparison-britain-united-kingdom/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Contributor Writer]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 16:43:48 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Editor's Picks]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[General]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGO & LEGOLAND News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGOLAND News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[LEGOLAND Resources]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.toysnbricks.com/?p=114412</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="2356" height="2356" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Castle-Hotel.webp" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGOLAND Windsor UK Castle Hotel" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Castle-Hotel.webp 2356w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Castle-Hotel-300x300.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Castle-Hotel-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Castle-Hotel-150x150.webp 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Castle-Hotel-768x768.webp 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Castle-Hotel-1536x1536.webp 1536w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Castle-Hotel-2048x2048.webp 2048w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 2356px) 100vw, 2356px" /></p>
<p>One thing I can say for sure is that LEGOLAND Windsor UK didn&#8217;t hold back on offering guests premium</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/legoland-uk-windsor-hotels-comparison-britain-united-kingdom/">LEGOLAND UK Windsor Hotels Comparison (Britain, United Kingdom)</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-105212 size-full" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner.jpg" alt="" width="1902" height="673" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner.jpg 1902w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner-300x106.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner-1024x362.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner-768x272.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-United-Kingdom-Entrance-Logo-Banner-1536x543.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1902px) 100vw, 1902px" /><br />
<span style="font-weight: 400;">One thing I can say for sure is that <a href="https://prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqa" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Windsor UK</a> didn&#8217;t hold back on offering guests premium accommodation. The three options you’ll see in this <a href="https://prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqa" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Windsor UK</a> hotels comparison are ideal for short stays and vacations. As you&#8217;d expect, they include our favorite LEGO-themed rooms at the on-site hotels.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you want to be a bit more adventurous and stay off-site, the resort has partner hotels as well. Even better, you can get theme park tickets when staying at any of the partner hotels off-site.</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114442 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Adventure-Golf-Playroom-Rides-Attractions-Shows-Experiences-Adventures.jpg" alt="" width="965" height="472" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Adventure-Golf-Playroom-Rides-Attractions-Shows-Experiences-Adventures.jpg 965w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Adventure-Golf-Playroom-Rides-Attractions-Shows-Experiences-Adventures-300x147.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Adventure-Golf-Playroom-Rides-Attractions-Shows-Experiences-Adventures-768x376.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 965px) 100vw, 965px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"> <a href="https://prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqa" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Windsor UK</a> is not just about the rollercoasters and attractions. It is a resort dedicated to complete unwinding even as it keeps your kids entertained. That said, this guide will help you decide which hotel to pick on your next trip to this Berkshire resort.</span></p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">Key Takeaways</span></h2>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGOLAND Windsor has three hotels: the LEGOLAND Woodland Village, the LEGOLAND Resort Hotel, and the LEGOLAND Castle Hotel.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">The hotels have their own restaurants to keep you full.</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">You’ll get a free LEGOLAND gift in your room, regardless of which hotel you book.</span></li>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays Now at Official LEGOLAND Europe Sites: </strong><a href="https://prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqa" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Windsor, United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Billund, Denmark</a> | <a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gunzburg, Germany</a></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114453 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-UK-Windsor-Hotel-Resort-Main-Front-Entrance.webp" alt="" width="800" height="800" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-UK-Windsor-Hotel-Resort-Main-Front-Entrance.webp 800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-UK-Windsor-Hotel-Resort-Main-Front-Entrance-300x300.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-UK-Windsor-Hotel-Resort-Main-Front-Entrance-150x150.webp 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-UK-Windsor-Hotel-Resort-Main-Front-Entrance-768x768.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" /></p>
<h2><span style="font-weight: 400;">Go Wild or Tame at the LEGOLAND Windsor Hotels</span></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">For your on-site lodging, the following options are available:</span></p>
<ol>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGOLAND Woodland Village</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGOLAND Resort Hotel</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGOLAND Castle Hotel</span></li>
</ol>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">These hotels host fun activities to preserve the playful atmosphere from the theme park. And that reminds me, you can expect a 1-day theme park ticket when you book any of these hotels.</span></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays Now at Official LEGOLAND Europe Sites: </strong><a href="https://prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqa" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Windsor, United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Billund, Denmark</a> | <a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gunzburg, Germany</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114446 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Restaurants-Bars-Shops-at-Hotels.jpg" alt="" width="1426" height="633" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Restaurants-Bars-Shops-at-Hotels.jpg 1426w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Restaurants-Bars-Shops-at-Hotels-300x133.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Restaurants-Bars-Shops-at-Hotels-1024x455.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Restaurants-Bars-Shops-at-Hotels-768x341.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1426px) 100vw, 1426px" /></p>
<h3><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGOLAND Woodland Village</span></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Maybe it’s because of who I am, but the LEGOLAND Woodland Village is my favorite. I love the outdoor setting, and if your kids love pirate role-play, they’ll find this hotel more notable than the others.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">This hotel holds much character, not just in its themed rooms. It offers 2 lodging options.</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Woodland Lodges</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">The Woodland Barrels</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Both options look like they came out of an Airbnb playbook. The Woodland Lodges bring styled rooms that are familiar and comparable to what you get at hotels. But do not mistake familiarity for boring, as I did.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The rooms and the ambience are the perfect family escape. You can fit a family of 5 in any of the rooms, with separate kids’ sleeping areas and bunk beds. You also get a LEGO build pit.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">I love the outdoor ambience and terrace features in this hotel, which gives it an advantage in this LEGOLAND UK Windsor hotels comparison. You can relax on the terrace while your kids have fun at the dedicated play spots in the hotel. Each lodge also offers interactive activities.</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114448 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Woodland-Village-Lodge-Barrels-Hotel-Rooms.jpg" alt="" width="1511" height="676" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Woodland-Village-Lodge-Barrels-Hotel-Rooms.jpg 1511w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Woodland-Village-Lodge-Barrels-Hotel-Rooms-300x134.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Woodland-Village-Lodge-Barrels-Hotel-Rooms-1024x458.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Woodland-Village-Lodge-Barrels-Hotel-Rooms-768x344.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1511px) 100vw, 1511px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">And if your kid aspires to be among the junior LEGOLAND Rangers, this hotel is the ideal place to stay. The rooms are themed as you’d expect, another plus for the hotel.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you don’t want the standard room options, you can opt for the barrel rooms. These offer a family glamping experience with over 50 rides and attractions a stone’s throw from where you stay. And despite featuring unique barrel–style rooms, you’ll get all the modern essentials, like lighting, free Wi-Fi, heaters, charging ports, etc.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Some of the benefits that come with staying at the Woodland barrels are</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">One-day theme park entry</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Breakfast at the Clubhouse</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Exclusive park access</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Free on-site parking</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Buy Tickets &amp; Book Hotel Stays Now at Official LEGOLAND Europe Sites: </strong><a href="https://prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqa" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Windsor, United Kingdom</a> | <a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Billund, Denmark</a> | <a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gunzburg, Germany</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114449 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Clubhouse-Shop-at-Woodlane-Village-Hotel.jpg" alt="" width="1387" height="430" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Clubhouse-Shop-at-Woodlane-Village-Hotel.jpg 1387w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Clubhouse-Shop-at-Woodlane-Village-Hotel-300x93.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Clubhouse-Shop-at-Woodlane-Village-Hotel-1024x317.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Clubhouse-Shop-at-Woodlane-Village-Hotel-768x238.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1387px) 100vw, 1387px" /></p>
<ul>
<li style="list-style-type: none;">
<ul>
<li style="list-style-type: none;"></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGOLAND Windsor Resort Hotel</span></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you want something more tame, the LEGOLAND Windsor Resort Hotel will do just that. The dragon-guarded entrance welcomes you to a hotel filled with interactive LEGO features, a splash pool, and fully themed rooms. And when you book it, you can customize your ticket to include the LEGOLAND Theme Park or the Adventure Golf tickets.</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114447 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Bricks-Restaurant-Skyline-Bar-and-Hotel-Shop.jpg" alt="" width="1487" height="708" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Bricks-Restaurant-Skyline-Bar-and-Hotel-Shop.jpg 1487w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Bricks-Restaurant-Skyline-Bar-and-Hotel-Shop-300x143.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Bricks-Restaurant-Skyline-Bar-and-Hotel-Shop-1024x488.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Bricks-Restaurant-Skyline-Bar-and-Hotel-Shop-768x366.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1487px) 100vw, 1487px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The packages at the LEGOLAND Windsor Resort Hotel are</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Breakfast at BRICKS Family Restaurant</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Early park access</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Free parking</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Access to the LEGO pirate-themed indoor water play area and swimming pool</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">I love the splash pool in the hotel, and I believe it is something every kid will want to try. You can cool down there if you visit the resort during the summer while your kids paddle and play.</span></p>
<p><em>Shown below is the LEGOLAND Windsor UK Pirate Splash Pool. Available for LEGOLAND UK Hotel Resort &amp; Castle Hotel Guests. </em></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114445 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Pirate-Splash-Pool-For-Hotel-Resort-Castle-Hotel-Guests.webp" alt="" width="840" height="560" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Pirate-Splash-Pool-For-Hotel-Resort-Castle-Hotel-Guests.webp 840w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Pirate-Splash-Pool-For-Hotel-Resort-Castle-Hotel-Guests-300x200.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Pirate-Splash-Pool-For-Hotel-Resort-Castle-Hotel-Guests-768x512.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 840px) 100vw, 840px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">For the rooms, the hotel offers 7 themes</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Pirate-themed room</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Adventure-themed room</span></li>
