</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The hotel lobby has thousands of LEGO bricks, the lifts are themed, and the corridors ensure you never lose the magic touch.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If your kids are all in with LEGO bricks, the LEGOLAND Windsor Resort Hotel is your best bet. They can also meet their favorite LEGO characters.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">For a bit more creativity, your kids can partake in the building competitions. Evening shows are also available to make your stay even more fun.</span></p>
