<h3><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGOLAND Castle Hotel</span></h3>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Now, to the last on-site hotel, the LEGOLAND Castle Hotel. Is it epic like the rest? Yes. It’s where you’ll find the knights, magic, kingdoms, and wizards. Maybe I said too much, but you get the point about what the theme will be.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The rooms are magic-themed, and you can choose the Knight’s room or the Wizard’s room. Both bring enchantment and magical spells to the lodging experience, making the hotel perfect for short stays.</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114444 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Castle-Hotel.webp" alt="" width="851" height="851" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Castle-Hotel.webp 2356w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Castle-Hotel-300x300.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Castle-Hotel-1024x1024.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Castle-Hotel-150x150.webp 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Castle-Hotel-768x768.webp 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Castle-Hotel-1536x1536.webp 1536w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Windsor-UK-Castle-Hotel-2048x2048.webp 2048w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 851px) 100vw, 851px" /></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">When you are ready to step out for food, you can try</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Tournament Tavern</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Bricks Restaurant</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Skyline Bar</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you love a bit more fun, you’ll enjoy the in-room treasure hunt with your kids. Those who have stayed at the </span><a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/legoland-florida-hotels-comparison-pirate-island-beach-retreat-hotel/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">LEGOLAND Florida hotels</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;"> will know how that works.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You’ll find boxes of LEGO bricks in the rooms. Even better, the hotel provides places for your kids to grab the bricks and build with them.</span></p>
