<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Note that only the LEGOLAND Woodland Village has a shop, the Clubhouse Shop. You can stock up on emergency items that you forgot or left behind on your trip. These include swim nappies, toiletries, toothpastes, and other essentials.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Another thing I love about the Clubhouse Shop is the availability of LEGO bricks. You’ll find classic and licensed sets, enough for you to get something that stays with you way beyond the trip. If you want to get a souvenir to mark your visit to the resort, this shop is worth checking out.</span></p>
