					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1152" height="946" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO City 60506 Classic Beach Streetcar June 2026 Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Front-Box.png 1152w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Front-Box-300x246.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Front-Box-1024x841.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Front-Box-768x631.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1152px) 100vw, 1152px" /></p>
<p>Happy Friday Evening LEGO Fans! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for tonight. Free shipping on orders</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/9-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-tonight-november-6-2026/">9 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for Tonight, November 6, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Happy Friday Evening LEGO Fans! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for tonight. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-109520 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="1255" height="996" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Back-Box.png 1800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Back-Box-300x238.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Back-Box-1024x813.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Back-Box-768x610.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/LEGO-City-60506-Classic-Beach-Streetcar-June-2026-Back-Box-1536x1219.png 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1255px) 100vw, 1255px" /></p>
<p>Personally, I think this set &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-TBD-City-Trains-60506/dp/B0G2T3YJ43?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=071bd1e9f31da77eaa5d906c38f42bd7&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO City Classic Beach Streetcar 60506</a> is a very nice kit and at <strong>15% off</strong> for <strong>$63.74</strong> (reg.$74.99), its not bad. <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-6588546-TBD-Botanicals-11506/dp/B0G2SZQS1C?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=df31bf60670a4e52ae6ff504171f4fd7&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Botanicals Rocking Plants 11506</a> at 20% off for <strong>$18.39</strong> (reg.$22.99) is pretty good too. A very cute flower set!</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-106266 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Botanicals-11506-Rocking-Plants-May-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="743" height="859" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Botanicals-11506-Rocking-Plants-May-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 743w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Botanicals-11506-Rocking-Plants-May-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-259x300.jpg 259w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 743px) 100vw, 743px" /></p>
<p>Below are 9 of our Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, November 6, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
